  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MaritimeCapacity: Strengthening the Maritime Security Centers in the Gulf of Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(48, 48, 48); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Contributing to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: rgb(48, 48, 48); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Specific Objective 3&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(48, 48, 48); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The capacities and capabilities of national and regional maritime security centres are strengthened.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.1 The capacities of the maritime structures of the Yaound&#xe9; Architecture are reinforced.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.2 The coordination among the maritime structures of the Yaound&#xe9; Architecture is strengthened.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
